; The bignum-free half of mirage-crypto-blockchain. Deliberately no zarith:
; these two modules need only digestif and the ec Ed25519 primitives, and
; keeping them separable is what lets an Ed25519-only consumer -- Cardano --
; link them into a Solo5 unikernel with no GMP anywhere in the duniverse.
;
; Nothing that needs a bignum may be added here. Put it in ../blockchain.
(library
 (name mirage_crypto_blockchain_core)
 (public_name mirage-crypto-blockchain-core)
 (libraries mirage-crypto-ec digestif)
 (private_modules blake2b ed25519_bip32))
